Package: viper488-symbiotic-visa
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Tommy Huang <gamalot@gmail.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgcc-s1, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libgtk-3-0
Recommends: fonts-noto-cjk
Section: electronics
Priority: optional
Description: VISA library for GPIB adapters, USBTMC, serial and LAN instruments
 Viper488 Symbiotic VISA Runtime: the VISA C API (libvisa64.so) for GPIB instruments behind
 Viper488, NI GPIB-USB-HS, Keysight 82357B and CONTEC GP-IB(USB)FL adapters and Prologix/AR488
 bridges, USBTMC instruments, serial ports and LAN instruments (VXI-11, HiSLIP, SOCKET).
 Installed in /usr/lib/symbiotic, with symbiotic-ctl and the configuration window
 symbiotic-config (a web page in WebKitGTK; fonts-noto-cjk for its Chinese). It does not
 take the system's libvisa.so name.
